cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use WAL++ in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "WAL++: Waveform Analysis Language in C++"
abstract: >-
  A C++20 reimplementation of the Waveform Analysis Language (WAL) for
  analysing VCD, FST and CSV simulation traces, with streaming support,
  fast Hamming weight/distance operators and Python bindings.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Rolf
    family-names: Meyer
    email: r.meyer@uni-luebeck.de
    affiliation: "Institute of Computer Engineering, Universität zu Lübeck"
  - given-names: Andrija
    family-names: Neskovic
    email: andrija.neskovic@uni-luebeck.de
    affiliation: "Institute of Computer Engineering, Universität zu Lübeck"
repository-code: "https://github.com/iti-luebeck/WALpp"
license: BSD-3-Clause
version: 1.2.2
keywords:
  - waveform analysis
  - VCD
  - FST
  - hardware verification
  - side-channel analysis
  - Hamming distance

